    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make full use of dimensions to clear the area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story begins in an empty space, and the world changes from a one-dimensional \u201cpoint\u201d to a two-dimensional \u201cplane\u201d to a three-dimensional \u201cdepth\u201d to a four-dimensional \u201ctime\u201d in this action game with a new sensation. Points and lines are born, depth expands, and the ability to manipulate time is acquired.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is full of stages full of tricks that open up new paths by making full use of the four powers of \u201congaku,\u201d \u201chi-key,\u201d \u201cshizen,\u201d and \u201cjikan\u201d and manipulating dimensions.</p>",
